      "content": "thanks for the tip. i checked the soil and it's definitely pretty soaked right now. i'm worried about the roots though cause i don't want to accidentally kill it. is there anything else that could cause yellowing? like maybe something in the environment or something \"unseen\" like a pest or something? it just feels like there's something off about the vibe of the plant lately.",
